# Reserved for the future timetable implementation.
#
# The eventual timetable renders with custom CSS Grid (NOT FullCalendar) and
# must preserve the backend lane semantics served by
# GET /api/timetable/<view>/<id>:
#   - day × period structure with `colspan` for multi-period blocks
#   - stacked lanes for parallel sessions / lab groups
#   - theory (steel) vs practical/lab (sage) distinction
#   - empty cells, day grouping, class cards
#
# Cell color semantics already live in src/index.css
# (.cell-theory / .cell-practical / .free-cell / .busy-cell).
